# @?TAIL - PRINT THE LAST RECORDS

## @?OPERANDS

### @?[NUMBER]
[NUMBER] OPERAND.

### @?[FILE]
[FILE] OPERAND.

## DESCRIPTION

TAIL PRINTS THE LAST TEN RECORDS BY DEFAULT, BOUNDED TO THIRTY ONE.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
